-- Every primitive operation, with results that can be checked by hand.
Commit(plus(2, 3))
Commit(minus(2, 3))
Commit(multiply(2.5, 4))
Commit(divide(7, 2))
Commit(modulo(7, 3))
Commit(modulo(-7, 3))
Commit(greater(3, 2))
Commit(greater(2, 3))
Commit(less(3, 2))
Commit(less(2, 3))
Commit(equal(2, 2))
Commit(equal(2, 3))
